  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional and Technical strengthening of the FDA, Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Actions overall objective, to which its activities and results will contribute, is to strengthen the health, social and economic situation in Ghana while mitigating the health impact of the COVID-19 crisis. The specific objective is to contribute to an enabling environment for local vaccine production in Ghana by strengthening the Ghanaian Food and Drugs Authority in their regulatory function for vaccines.The Actions specific objective contributes to the achievement of the ADs outcome        definition: Contribute to an enabling environment for local vaccine production in Ghana by strengthening the Ghanaian Food and Drugs Authority in their regulatory function for vaccines. The Actions three outputs are as follows:1.Systems and capacities for vaccine market authorization and dossier evaluation at FDA Ghana are in place;2.A lot release system in FDA Ghana based on WHO guidelines is established;3.The laboratory system of FDA Ghana is strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
